msgid "info_page/additional/bonus/description"
msgstr ""
"Once you complete three Standard Missions, a Bonus Mission becomes "
"available, offering even more valuable rewards. The Bonus Mission must be "
"completed by the end of the day, or it will expire."

msgid "info_page/additional/bonus/title"
msgstr "Bonus Mission"

msgid "info_page/additional/conditions/description"
msgstr ""
"Some missions must be completed in one battle, while others are accumulative"
" and can be completed over any number of battles. Accumulative missions have"
" a progress bar. You can complete missions in Random Battles."

msgid "info_page/additional/conditions/title"
msgstr "Conditions"

msgid "info_page/additional/reroll/description"
msgstr ""
"You can re-roll an unwanted Standard Mission to receive a random new one. "
"After this, the Mission Re-roll button will become unavailable for {{time}}."
" Re-rolling a mission may cause you to lose your progress if one or more of "
"your vehicles are in battle."

msgid "info_page/additional/reroll/title"
msgstr "Mission Re-roll"

msgid "info_page/additional/reward/description"
msgstr ""
"Epic Reward is a marathon-like cycle, with every completed Standard, "
"Premium, and Bonus Mission contributing toward its progress. Once the cycle "
"is completed, it resets and starts over. The Epic Reward cycle has no time "
"limit and can be completed at any time."

msgid "info_page/additional/reward/title"
msgstr "Epic Reward"

msgid "info_page/header"
msgstr "ABOUT MISSIONS"

msgid "info_page/main/premium/description"
msgstr ""
"With WoT Premium Account, you gain access to three sequential Premium "
"Missions. These can be completed in Random Battles and Onslaught, with "
"progress updated after each battle. During game events, Premium Missions "
"provide event-specific rewards."

msgid "info_page/main/premium/title"
msgstr "Premium Missions"

msgid "info_page/main/standard/description"
msgstr ""
"Standard Missions are random daily conditions whose progress is updated "
"after each battle. We recommend completing them the day you receive them, as"
" unfinished missions carry over to the next day and block new ones. Standard"
" Missions provide Battle Pass Points during Battle Pass and event-specific "
"rewards during other game events."

msgid "info_page/main/standard/title"
msgstr "Standard Missions"

msgid "info_page/main/weekly/description"
msgstr ""
"Weekly Missions are a set of tasks available every week. Progress is updated"
" after each battle, and completed missions are replaced with new ones when "
"the next weekly cycle begins. You can complete Weekly Missions in Random "
"Battles and Onslaught mode to receive additional bonuses."

msgid "info_page/main/weekly/title"
msgstr "Weekly Missions"

